# Icons: ng-icons + Heroicons

## Preferred icon system

- Use `ng-icons` with **Heroicons** for app icons in templates and UI components.
- Keep icon usage consistent across features instead of mixing multiple icon sets for similar actions.

## Selection workflow

- Pick icon names from the official browser before adding them:
  - [https://ng-icons.github.io/ng-icons/#/browse-icons](https://ng-icons.github.io/ng-icons/#/browse-icons)
- Do not guess icon names or invent variants that are not listed in the browser.

## Usage consistency

- Use one Heroicons style per context (outline or solid) and keep it consistent within the same screen/feature.
- Keep icon sizing and alignment consistent with nearby text/components; prefer shared utility classes or existing component patterns.
- Decorative icons should be visually subtle; action/state icons should remain clear and recognizable.

## Do / don't

```text
DO: Use Heroicons via ng-icons for common UI actions (search, edit, delete, navigation).
DO: Verify icon names in the ng-icons browser before committing.

DON'T: Mix unrelated icon packs for identical actions in the same feature.
DON'T: Hardcode ad-hoc icon naming assumptions without checking the official list.
```
